  "title": "1300 张卡叫板 10 万卡！前 OpenAI 副总裁出手，硬核难题击败 GPT-6 Astra",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3MTA0MTk1MA==&mid=2652726865&idx=3&sn=8fa5d500054a776a123bdbb19d8efbbf",
  "date": "2026-09-17 15:05:00",
  "author": "新智元",
